Require authentication on media streaming endpoints

Only DefaultPolicy is configured in ApiServiceCollectionExtensions -- there is no
FallbackPolicy and no global AuthorizeFilter -- so an action without an explicit
[Authorize] carries no authorization metadata and is served anonymously.

The item id is not a secret either: LibraryManager derives it as
MD5(type.FullName + path), so a guessable path yields a downloadable stream.

Verified against this server: GET /Items/{id} returns 401 while
GET /Audio/{id}/stream?static=true returns 206 with the media body, no token.

